# Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OAuth / API token caches (refresh tokens rotate here, outside git)
.tokens/
*.token.json
*token_cache*

# SQLite databases
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# EXCEPTION: the multi-athlete demo DB is a committed, PORTABLE test artifact
# (synthetic Strava + real erg, stored PLAINTEXT on purpose so any checkout can
# open it — production sync still encrypts). See DECISIONS.md.
!athletes_test.db

# Local training-data fixture: REAL personal data. Ships only if anonymized.
# See DECISIONS.md (repo-privacy decision) before un-ignoring.
tests/fixtures/*.xlsx
Triathlon Training Sync.xlsx - *.csv
# Any real workbook at the repo root (e.g. "Copy of Triathlon Training Sync.xlsx").
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
# EXCEPTION: AG authorized committing the two workbooks the demo runs on so the
# pipeline is testable without their Strava/Sheets. See DECISIONS.md.
!rowing_women_2025-2026 ERGS-2.xlsx
!Copy of Triathlon Training Sync.xlsx

